# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docs site — environment variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# On Vercel you usually do NOT need to set anything: VERCEL_* vars are injected
# automatically. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL only when you need a fixed canonical
# URL (e.g. custom domain before DNS is wired, or local tunnel).
#
# Dashboard: Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL → Production only → https://dimah-s3.vercel.app
#
# Auto-injected by Vercel (do not copy into .env.local):
#   VERCEL_URL
#   VERCEL_ENV                    production | preview | development
#   VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL production hostname (custom or *.vercel.app)
#
# Local dev (optional):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
